WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.310 --> 01:46.700
=Episode 27=

01:49.720 --> 01:50.990
Murderer!

02:08.479 --> 02:09.130
Maiming.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.230
Maiming.

02:11.960 --> 02:12.750
Maiming.

02:13.200 --> 02:13.590
Maiming.

02:14.160 --> 02:14.830
Maiming.

02:14.830 --> 02:15.840
Congratulations.

02:16.550 --> 02:17.070
Maiming.

02:17.070 --> 02:18.520
You took your revenge.

02:18.960 --> 02:20.300
It's you.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.120
You killed my father!

02:22.120 --> 02:22.870
Don't come over!

02:25.640 --> 02:26.800
My Zhaoyan

02:27.840 --> 02:30.750
is such an innocent
and upright silly girl.

02:32.710 --> 02:33.190
Maiming.

02:34.430 --> 02:35.020
Maiming.

02:38.320 --> 02:39.690
You are Zhaoyan?

02:45.320 --> 02:46.360
You are both in this together.

02:48.230 --> 02:48.960
It's you!

02:50.150 --> 02:51.870
You also helped kill my father!

02:52.230 --> 02:53.510
You are also a murderer!

02:54.440 --> 02:59.040
- Kill her.
- kill her.

03:02.790 --> 03:03.590
Take him away first.

03:03.680 --> 03:04.430
Okay.

03:04.790 --> 03:06.680
Hold on.

03:10.080 --> 03:11.040
Don't run away!

03:12.680 --> 03:13.290
Maiming.

03:17.150 --> 03:17.770
Maiming.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.110
Hold on.

03:28.000 --> 03:28.470
Maiming.

03:29.550 --> 03:30.150
Maiming.

03:34.910 --> 03:35.320
Maiming.

03:37.000 --> 03:37.579
Maiming.

03:39.079 --> 03:39.680
Maiming.

03:41.470 --> 03:41.960
Maiming!

03:44.300 --> 03:45.150
Maiming!

03:46.040 --> 03:48.230
You mustn't die, Maiming.

03:48.790 --> 03:49.550
Maiming.

03:49.590 --> 03:50.470
You silly girl.

03:53.200 --> 03:55.079
I've racked my brains

03:55.600 --> 03:57.160
to drive you out of the Luo family

03:58.110 --> 04:00.750
just to keep you from getting hurt.

04:01.600 --> 04:02.950
Why are you so silly

04:05.110 --> 04:06.310
and stubborn?

04:06.310 --> 04:07.830
I wasn't stubborn.

04:08.360 --> 04:09.260
Maiming.

04:09.720 --> 04:11.190
You are my only family.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.470
I'll listen to you from now on.

04:13.470 --> 04:15.880
I won't let you die. You mustn't die.

04:16.390 --> 04:16.910
Maiming!

04:17.800 --> 04:18.910
You mustn't die.

04:22.830 --> 04:24.360
You shouldn't cry.

04:25.110 --> 04:25.870
It...

04:26.600 --> 04:28.280
it isn't easy for me

04:29.030 --> 04:29.800
to finally

04:31.470 --> 04:32.110
die.

04:35.470 --> 04:36.670
Moreover,

04:38.520 --> 04:39.720
a murderer

04:41.800 --> 04:43.190
is to be killed in return.

04:47.520 --> 04:47.950
No.

04:48.880 --> 04:50.030
Maiming, you mustn't die.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.520
You cannot die.

04:56.440 --> 04:57.159
Rehai.

04:58.159 --> 04:59.310
Rehai has the life force.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.310
It can save you, right?

05:01.550 --> 05:02.110
Re...

05:03.160 --> 05:04.240
Silly girl.

05:06.640 --> 05:11.310
You are the guardian of Rehai now.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.880
I don't want it.

05:12.950 --> 05:13.880
I don't want it.

05:18.550 --> 05:19.800
I don't want it.

05:24.030 --> 05:28.280
Though I'm already
deeply trapped in endless abyss,

05:31.360 --> 05:32.159
yet still,

05:33.520 --> 05:36.909
I wish you enjoy endless peace and joy.

05:44.640 --> 05:45.670
Zhaoyan.

05:47.670 --> 05:49.310
The condemnation of heaven on Luo family

05:51.110 --> 05:52.830
has finally ended.

05:55.159 --> 05:55.750
Maiming.

05:56.550 --> 05:57.640
I'm so tired.

06:00.160 --> 06:02.760
I want to rest for a while.

06:03.600 --> 06:04.320
Don't.

06:26.200 --> 06:27.070
Maiming.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.070
Maiming.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.880
Maiming!

06:36.480 --> 06:37.670
Maiming!

06:43.790 --> 06:44.550
Maiming.

06:55.110 --> 06:56.000
Why have you returned?

06:57.040 --> 06:58.159
According to the original plan,

06:58.920 --> 07:00.970
we should have found
a remote village to hide in temporarily,

07:01.880 --> 07:04.070
and come back to look for Master
after the storm subsided.

07:06.510 --> 07:08.510
I have but three days to live.

07:09.670 --> 07:10.600
In that case,

07:12.200 --> 07:14.070
I might as well die where I should die.

07:16.320 --> 07:17.390
Will you really be satisfied

07:18.630 --> 07:19.440
if you can just die?

07:22.440 --> 07:25.000
I consider myself to be
a very greedy person.

07:27.040 --> 07:27.880
Very greedy.

07:31.920 --> 07:33.070
When the time comes,

07:35.440 --> 07:36.620
hand the letter to them.

07:36.620 --> 07:41.040
♪Like threads weaving misty rain
into a painting♪

07:41.800 --> 07:46.360
(Ju Shifang, Ming Xiu)
♪Forming a bond reminiscent of a rainbow♪

07:46.760 --> 07:51.630
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

07:51.630 --> 07:52.630
See you in the next life.

07:54.480 --> 07:55.200
The next life?

07:57.950 --> 08:00.520
My life has been entangled with the
condemnation of heaven for many years.

08:02.200 --> 08:04.280
At the time of lifting
the bloodbinding of Rehai,

08:04.950 --> 08:06.790
in order to prevent Zhaoyan
from getting hurt,

08:06.790 --> 08:08.000
it was forcibly stopped.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.440
I no longer have a next life.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.470
Take care.

08:23.850 --> 08:29.800
♪Betting your whole life♪

08:30.410 --> 08:35.470
♪No answer, no giving up♪

08:41.840 --> 08:47.660
♪Writing about your struggle♪

08:47.660 --> 08:53.420
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

08:54.120 --> 08:59.900
♪Betting your whole life♪

09:00.690 --> 09:06.010
♪No answer, no giving up♪

09:27.830 --> 09:29.200
This is the secret chamber of Maiming.

09:31.440 --> 09:32.630
I have never entered here before.

10:02.920 --> 10:03.470
This...

10:05.350 --> 10:06.760
Isn't this the painting I drew?

10:50.870 --> 10:51.720
(He kept my paintings)

10:53.040 --> 10:54.390
(well preserved.)

10:58.600 --> 10:59.600
(I highly value)

11:00.830 --> 11:02.600
(the paintings you gave to me.)

11:13.510 --> 11:14.920
(We are connected.)

11:16.480 --> 11:18.250
(I always care about you.)

11:22.390 --> 11:23.360
It's just a pity

11:24.510 --> 11:25.800
that I couldn't see

11:26.480 --> 11:27.310
your paintings

11:29.990 --> 11:33.960
together with you like I had wished to.

11:36.870 --> 11:37.510
In the next life,

11:38.920 --> 11:41.160
I'll join you to see
all the scenery in the world.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.200
The next life?

11:52.040 --> 11:53.040
Alright.

12:02.830 --> 12:03.560
Maiming.

12:19.750 --> 12:20.870
He's fulfilled

12:21.990 --> 12:23.600
his own wishes in all the paintings.

12:27.240 --> 12:28.480
In my dream yesterday,

12:30.160 --> 12:31.280
I dreamed of what happened

12:32.360 --> 12:34.390
to the Luo family
on the day of Rehai bloodbinding.

12:36.990 --> 12:38.240
Maiming's soul

12:39.190 --> 12:40.990
was thus permanently trapped here.

12:43.390 --> 12:44.950
Because I had to lend my life to him,

12:45.800 --> 12:46.950
I was destined to pass away early.

12:51.750 --> 12:53.070
So I told Maiming

12:55.360 --> 12:56.830
that I was willing
to lend my life to him,

12:58.280 --> 13:00.160
and I was also willing
to live and die with him.

13:03.750 --> 13:05.720
Why wouldn't he just believe me?

13:08.560 --> 13:09.600
(Having been lonely for long,)

13:11.190 --> 13:13.720
(you can meet someone
who would rather give up her own life)

13:15.480 --> 13:16.830
(than to give up on you.)

13:18.920 --> 13:19.390
(Is that why)

13:21.190 --> 13:23.120
(you forcibly terminated
the spell then?)

13:24.750 --> 13:25.510
(Luo Maiming.)

13:28.280 --> 13:29.870
Perhaps it was just for me

13:32.070 --> 13:33.680
that Maiming rushed
to lift the bloodbinding.

13:35.720 --> 13:36.310
Luo Maiming

13:37.280 --> 13:38.920
could continuously borrow life
to be reborn,

13:39.680 --> 13:40.680
while I have

13:41.630 --> 13:42.800
only one life.

13:45.920 --> 13:47.390
As he killed so many people,

13:48.510 --> 13:50.040
he should've deserved to be killed.

13:54.830 --> 13:55.990
But in this world,

13:58.630 --> 14:01.240
I am the one least qualified
to condemn him.

14:05.240 --> 14:06.070
Xian Qing,

14:08.950 --> 14:10.630
I don't know what to do.

14:14.680 --> 14:15.500
If that is the case,

14:17.830 --> 14:18.830
then use the rest of your life

14:19.560 --> 14:20.360
to atone for his crime.

14:26.600 --> 14:27.400
Atone for his crime?

14:32.040 --> 14:32.880
Atone for his crime?

14:39.310 --> 14:40.360
Atone for his crime?

14:45.280 --> 14:46.040
Is that possible?

14:56.240 --> 14:56.990
Definitely.

14:59.160 --> 14:59.820
Zhaoyan.

15:01.190 --> 15:02.280
I will do it together with you.

15:46.750 --> 15:47.920
I have something to do.

15:50.160 --> 15:51.120
But I want to go alone.

16:02.560 --> 16:03.720
I know you want to accompany me.

16:06.040 --> 16:08.160
This is the final concern
of Luo family's Master.

16:09.630 --> 16:10.700
I want to handle it myself.

16:18.160 --> 16:18.510
Alright.

16:24.480 --> 16:25.230
Do you see her?

16:25.310 --> 16:26.870
The Luo family members
in the Western Regions

16:27.120 --> 16:28.190
died because of this person.

16:28.950 --> 16:30.860
Hasn't the Luo family's reputation
always been good?

16:31.240 --> 16:33.390
It has changed since the day
of the grand family ceremony.

16:33.800 --> 16:35.950
It's said that over a hundred people
were killed.

16:36.070 --> 16:37.430
- Over a hundred people were killed?
- Over a hundred people were killed?

16:37.430 --> 16:38.870
She is such a female demon!

16:38.870 --> 16:39.720
What is she here for?

16:39.720 --> 16:40.490
What is she doing here?

16:42.950 --> 16:44.650
- Definitely up to no good.
- Let's go have a look.

16:46.560 --> 16:48.070
She is up to no good.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.950
Luo Zhaoyan, what are you here for?

16:51.510 --> 16:53.360
This wasn't done by us.

16:53.560 --> 16:56.040
This was smashed by the families
of those you've killed.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.310
Don't worry.

16:59.190 --> 17:00.240
I will not harm you.

17:00.800 --> 17:01.630
By the way,

17:01.630 --> 17:03.310
I will not continue to serve
at your home.

17:03.720 --> 17:05.680
I am afraid to be criticized
by people behind my back.

17:14.560 --> 17:15.920
What is this?

17:15.920 --> 17:16.390
Yeah.

17:17.119 --> 17:17.680
Everyone.

17:18.510 --> 17:20.190
I am the former Master
of the Luo family,

17:20.920 --> 17:21.430
Luo Zhaoyan.

17:22.240 --> 17:24.829
Today, I ask all present
to bear witness.

17:26.040 --> 17:26.869
From today on,

17:27.430 --> 17:29.120
all the properties under the name
of Maiming and I

17:29.510 --> 17:31.630
shall belong to the stewards and clerks.

17:33.240 --> 17:35.630
And please also help me sell off
all the properties that we've deposited

17:36.360 --> 17:37.510
in money dealers and other places

17:38.070 --> 17:39.760
to compensate the families
of the deceased.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.920
I am here today.

17:44.510 --> 17:46.040
If any of you have
any grievances or hatred,

17:46.040 --> 17:47.070
feel free to take it out on me.

17:47.870 --> 17:49.000
Do not harm the innocent.

17:50.830 --> 17:51.990
I am the only one

17:52.870 --> 17:54.120
to scrape by in this world.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.360
My mother says
you're a murderous lunatic!

17:59.630 --> 18:00.490
Kill her!

18:00.990 --> 18:01.630
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:01.630 --> 18:02.360
I'll kill you!

18:02.360 --> 18:03.190
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:03.430 --> 18:09.160
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:09.160 --> 18:11.120
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:11.120 --> 18:12.390
She deceived people!

18:12.950 --> 18:13.800
Murderous lunatic!

18:14.830 --> 18:15.600
Shameless!

18:15.600 --> 18:16.560
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:16.560 --> 18:18.310
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:18.390 --> 18:19.240
I'll kill you!

18:22.640 --> 18:23.630
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

18:25.070 --> 18:25.840
Enough!

18:28.390 --> 18:29.390
Who is this?

18:39.630 --> 18:40.870
Didn't I say I would come alone?

18:43.430 --> 18:44.070
You could come.

18:44.920 --> 18:45.750
I could follow too.

18:48.920 --> 18:50.920
Most of you are not
related to the Luo family.

18:51.840 --> 18:54.440
Over the years, you have also
received favors from the Luo family.

18:56.630 --> 18:58.190
Yet today you turn against them
so quickly.

18:59.960 --> 19:00.470
Come on.

19:03.870 --> 19:04.590
Keep throwing!

19:07.470 --> 19:08.870
- Go.
- Go.

19:08.870 --> 19:09.680
Xian Qing.

19:19.200 --> 19:20.010
Let's go.

19:22.440 --> 19:22.960
Thank you.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.320
If other people can't scold you,

19:26.710 --> 19:27.390
what about me?

19:28.630 --> 19:29.510
Can I scold you?

19:42.510 --> 19:43.200
She knelt down.

19:43.630 --> 19:44.390
She knelt down.

19:51.200 --> 19:54.710
For the rest of my life,
I will atone for this.

19:57.630 --> 19:58.470
From now on,

20:03.230 --> 20:04.750
I will no longer set foot
in Yinghui Fort.

20:08.470 --> 20:09.320
Right.

20:11.470 --> 20:13.420
How dare Luo Maiming
who slaughtered all his own kin,

20:14.110 --> 20:15.350
and you, Luo Zhaoyan,

20:16.920 --> 20:18.590
ever come back here again?

20:22.440 --> 20:23.720
This place

20:24.390 --> 20:26.680
has been stained by the blood
of those you two killed.

20:29.110 --> 20:29.840
Luo Zhaoyan.

20:31.630 --> 20:32.920
You are cold-blooded and heartless,

20:35.110 --> 20:37.470
and no different from a demon beast
that devours humans alive.

20:37.710 --> 20:38.840
You don't deserve to be a human!

20:41.990 --> 20:42.710
Get out!

20:59.800 --> 21:00.870
Kneeling down once is enough.

21:02.350 --> 21:03.400
It's not your fault anyway.

21:05.390 --> 21:05.960
Let's go.

21:10.630 --> 21:11.630
Luo Zhaoyan!

21:12.590 --> 21:13.750
I hate you!

21:20.230 --> 21:21.260
I hate you.

21:22.200 --> 21:23.280
- Go.
- Go.

21:23.590 --> 21:24.680
- Let's leave.
- Let's leave.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.350
I hate you.

21:31.120 --> 21:32.010
Zhaoyan.

21:33.800 --> 21:35.020
What do you plan to do next?

21:38.390 --> 21:41.280
As long as the righteousness remains intact,
there will still be a path to follow.

21:43.590 --> 21:44.400
For the rest of my life,

21:45.160 --> 21:46.320
I will try to do more good deeds

21:47.040 --> 21:48.630
to atone for the sins of Maiming and I.

21:49.750 --> 21:52.840
I seek no fame or fortune.
I wanna stay true to myself.

21:55.990 --> 21:57.160
No matter how the world sees you,

21:59.040 --> 22:00.160
I will always be by your side.

22:13.750 --> 22:14.280
(Qi,)

22:16.390 --> 22:17.550
(where on the earth are you?)

22:45.800 --> 22:46.280
Yue.

22:46.920 --> 22:47.320
Have a seat.

22:51.680 --> 22:52.110
Yue.

22:52.680 --> 22:54.040
Sorry to make you worry these past days.

22:55.680 --> 22:57.130
Miss Yue's whereabouts remain unknown.

22:57.320 --> 22:58.390
Yet you have been implicated

22:58.590 --> 22:59.840
and couldn't go to search for her.

23:01.960 --> 23:04.510
I also failed to ask Maiming
for clues in time.

23:05.160 --> 23:05.960
I am truly sorry.

23:07.840 --> 23:09.470
The Luo family has encountered
such a disaster.

23:09.470 --> 23:10.470
It has distractd you.

23:11.160 --> 23:11.710
Besides,

23:12.870 --> 23:14.750
I have been searching everywhere
these past two days,

23:14.750 --> 23:16.510
and I still can't find
the location of the Yujie Hub.

23:17.160 --> 23:19.110
So it's all the same wherever I am.

23:23.280 --> 23:25.470
Isn't it that you can sense
each other's whereabouts

23:25.870 --> 23:27.800
using the Mindlink
between Miss Yue and you?

23:29.110 --> 23:29.590
Yes.

23:30.440 --> 23:31.600
I have also tried that.

23:32.040 --> 23:33.230
The resonance between Qi and I

23:33.560 --> 23:35.160
seems to be blocked
by some external force.

23:37.510 --> 23:39.320
It must be something done by Ying Xuwei.

23:42.080 --> 23:43.390
De'er!

23:43.590 --> 23:44.440
De'er!

23:44.590 --> 23:46.350
Have you seen my De'er?

23:49.040 --> 23:49.320
De...

23:50.230 --> 23:52.110
Have you seen my De'er?

23:53.510 --> 23:54.200
Uncle.

23:54.920 --> 23:55.800
Who is De'er?

23:56.960 --> 23:59.390
So you haven't seen him either.

24:00.200 --> 24:01.470
De'er!

24:01.990 --> 24:04.080
De'er!

24:04.350 --> 24:06.350
It must be because of something done
by Luo family in secret.

24:07.320 --> 24:07.990
Otherwise,

24:08.960 --> 24:10.960
Nian had been treating
his grandson well,

24:11.590 --> 24:13.710
why did he suddenly turn into
a stone a few days ago?

24:15.160 --> 24:15.750
Sir.

24:16.470 --> 24:17.920
Other than person's grandson,

24:18.280 --> 24:19.800
are there any others
who have turned to stone?

24:19.800 --> 24:20.470
How do you know?

24:21.280 --> 24:22.960
So you really have something
to do with this?

24:22.960 --> 24:23.920
Alright, stop talking.

24:24.040 --> 24:25.960
Aren't you afraid they'll harm you?
Just go now.

24:26.080 --> 24:27.040
Go, go.

24:30.710 --> 24:32.920
Although the headquarters
of the Qiyuan Sect has been destroyed,

24:32.920 --> 24:34.960
there could still be some
that slipped through the net.

24:35.320 --> 24:37.470
Luo family originally had
significant influence in this area,

24:37.710 --> 24:39.310
so we could've deterred them
to some extent.

24:39.960 --> 24:40.750
But now...

24:41.510 --> 24:42.990
The Hengdao Sect must
be related to this.

24:43.710 --> 24:44.960
We must send
send a message to Mr. Zuo

24:45.840 --> 24:48.200
to ask Zhengwu Alliance to help protect
the citizens of Yinghui Fort,

24:48.750 --> 24:50.920
and also ask him to join us in searching
for the Hengdao Sect.

24:55.280 --> 24:56.510
Are you Yue Jinzhao?

24:57.510 --> 24:59.560
Someone asked me
to give you this letter.

25:09.510 --> 25:10.510
It is Qi's jade pendant.

25:12.270 --> 25:14.160
(Lock River Mountain)

25:14.920 --> 25:15.960
Lock River Mountain?

25:16.990 --> 25:18.800
I've never heard of this place before.

25:20.350 --> 25:22.230
But since they have sent the letter,

25:22.630 --> 25:24.990
how about you try the Mindlink again?

25:36.630 --> 25:37.350
I seem

25:38.470 --> 25:39.160
to find her.

25:40.320 --> 25:41.280
I seem to have found Qi.

25:44.080 --> 25:45.200
I will send a message to Xiu

25:45.800 --> 25:47.590
to let her and Shifang meet up with us.

26:01.630 --> 26:03.960
Why would the Hengdao Sect
give us a location that no one knows,

26:04.350 --> 26:06.600
and deliberately cut off
your connection with Little Yue?

26:06.960 --> 26:07.630
Looks like

26:08.160 --> 26:09.770
they're trying to lure us there.

26:11.710 --> 26:12.590
They also want to see

26:13.390 --> 26:14.590
whether I can find Qi

26:15.320 --> 26:16.350
just relying on Mindlink.

26:28.870 --> 26:29.900
It's on the north side.

26:36.960 --> 26:37.750
What's wrong?

26:38.990 --> 26:40.040
The Mindlink

26:41.230 --> 26:42.380
seems to have failed again.

27:27.870 --> 27:28.440
Jinzhao!

27:28.440 --> 27:28.960
Shifang.

27:30.350 --> 27:30.840
Jinzhao!

27:34.750 --> 27:35.660
It's still not enough.

27:38.080 --> 27:38.760
It doesn't matter.

27:39.390 --> 27:40.110
If it is needed,

27:40.800 --> 27:41.800
we can assist you.

27:44.040 --> 27:44.920
It's useless.

27:45.870 --> 27:46.800
I can only rely on myself.

27:47.560 --> 27:48.680
The Mindlink

27:49.590 --> 27:52.680
is only related to the love
of Qi and me.

27:53.680 --> 27:54.350
This time,

27:56.280 --> 27:57.680
I must rely on myself.

28:04.750 --> 28:05.110
Jinzhao.

28:05.390 --> 28:06.680
We must have another way.

28:06.750 --> 28:08.110
Please don't hurt yourself.

28:10.040 --> 28:10.710
(Try again.)

28:12.230 --> 28:13.350
(If it's still unsuccessful,)

28:14.630 --> 28:18.440
(even if I have to search
every inch of the divine land)

28:19.870 --> 28:21.510
(I must find Qi.)

29:01.960 --> 29:03.560
You found it!

29:38.630 --> 29:40.280
I've heard about what happened

29:41.350 --> 29:42.280
in these past few days.

29:42.800 --> 29:43.880
I didn't expect that...

29:43.990 --> 29:45.080
It's okay, Ming Xiu.

29:46.280 --> 29:47.400
Thank you for your concern.

29:48.440 --> 29:49.390
I have decided

29:50.440 --> 29:52.140
to live on carrying Maiming's efforts

29:52.720 --> 29:53.960
as a continuation

29:54.710 --> 29:55.350
of his life.

29:59.470 --> 30:00.080
I understand.

30:02.080 --> 30:02.560
Xiu.

30:03.800 --> 30:05.770
Have you brought the thing
I asked you to bring for me?

30:11.800 --> 30:12.320
Thank you.

30:14.390 --> 30:15.630
Keep them well.

30:16.230 --> 30:18.510
These are all that's left
the master refined for you.

30:19.110 --> 30:21.160
If you continue to casually
give away your energy to others,

30:22.390 --> 30:24.440
sooner or later you will turn
into your original form.

30:26.800 --> 30:28.430
Zhaoyan likes my skin and fur
quite a bit.

30:29.280 --> 30:30.350
If that day really comes,

30:31.080 --> 30:32.160
Zhaoyan will take me in.

30:33.160 --> 30:34.040
No problem.

30:38.470 --> 30:39.630
It's just

30:40.590 --> 30:42.160
that I'm penniless right now.

30:43.050 --> 30:44.280
If you follow me in the future,

30:44.280 --> 30:45.710
you might have to be a vegetarian.

30:47.680 --> 30:49.080
I've had quite a bit of meat.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.960
Trying out vegetarianism
is also quite good.

31:00.160 --> 31:01.160
Jinzhao.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.960
Why would the Hengdao Sect
want to capture Little Yue?

31:04.040 --> 31:05.590
Maybe it's because there's
a trend of breakdown

31:05.590 --> 31:07.630
in the dealings between Zhu Yu
and the Hengdao Sect.

31:08.630 --> 31:11.040
Therefore, the Hengdao Sect
took Qi as a hostage.

31:13.510 --> 31:14.200
Nine Springs.

31:14.920 --> 31:15.630
The Hengdao Sect.

31:16.320 --> 31:17.350
The Sea of Clear Skies.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.470
All of this is like a mystery,

31:21.230 --> 31:22.390
enveloping Qi and me.

31:24.200 --> 31:25.840
To unravel all these mysteries,

31:26.750 --> 31:27.920
I can only ask Ying Xuwei.

31:35.680 --> 31:36.110
Look!

31:36.320 --> 31:38.280
There is a city floating
in the sky over there!

31:41.230 --> 31:41.680
(Qi.)

31:42.710 --> 31:43.350
(Wait for me.)

32:01.320 --> 32:02.390
Truly unlike the mortal world.

32:02.960 --> 32:04.390
It is inferior to the azure beyond,

32:04.390 --> 32:06.000
yet it is at the pinnacle
of the human world.

32:06.960 --> 32:08.280
Making a fuss over nothing.

32:08.280 --> 32:10.040
Doesn't the Yunlai Stone also
move through the sky?

32:10.960 --> 32:11.470
No.

32:11.870 --> 32:12.680
You don't know.

32:13.110 --> 32:15.750
This city is not floating
by magic or energy,

32:16.350 --> 32:17.440
but by gadget techniques.

32:18.470 --> 32:19.470
You are quite knowledgeable.

32:23.390 --> 32:23.840
Where is Qi?

32:24.440 --> 32:25.110
I want to see Qi.

32:25.590 --> 32:26.440
If you want to see her,

32:26.440 --> 32:27.530
you have to get past me first.

32:28.590 --> 32:30.040
Wasn't it you who called us here?

32:30.390 --> 32:31.560
Why do we still have to fight?

32:32.590 --> 32:34.320
You hurt Luohuan so much.

32:34.510 --> 32:35.870
I'm going to beat you hard.

32:36.390 --> 32:36.990
(Xiaoyuan.)

32:37.560 --> 32:39.210
(What did eldest brother
tell you just now?)

32:39.440 --> 32:40.720
(Do you want to be punished by him?)

32:41.800 --> 32:44.040
(Eldest brother has a word specifically
for Yue Jinzhao and Yue Qi.)

32:44.390 --> 32:45.930
(You can follow her to the guest room.)

32:46.160 --> 32:46.990
You want to stop us?

32:48.280 --> 32:48.870
Xiu.

32:49.470 --> 32:50.630
Since we're here, let's settle in.

32:51.510 --> 32:53.040
We need to trust Jinzhao and Little Yue.

32:54.840 --> 32:55.470
Lead the way.

33:03.960 --> 33:04.810
Follow me.

33:09.640 --> 33:10.750
She is inside.

33:20.560 --> 33:21.280
Jinzhao.

33:31.740 --> 33:34.850
♪Looking back♪

33:35.740 --> 33:38.590
♪I try to bring back memories♪

33:39.610 --> 33:43.610
♪We're connected♪

33:43.840 --> 33:45.950
♪It's meant to be♪

33:47.650 --> 33:50.800
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

33:51.870 --> 33:54.850
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

33:55.580 --> 33:57.760
♪On a moonlight night♪

33:57.760 --> 33:59.580
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

33:59.840 --> 34:01.980
♪About you♪

34:02.530 --> 34:05.760
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

34:06.530 --> 34:09.840
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

34:10.489 --> 34:12.350
♪The past glided before my mind♪

34:12.350 --> 34:14.590
♪I smiled and cried♪

34:14.590 --> 34:19.330
♪For happiness♪

34:19.840 --> 34:23.550
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

34:23.840 --> 34:27.770
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

34:27.770 --> 34:29.790
♪In this tranquil world♪

34:29.790 --> 34:31.770
♪I've finally found you♪

34:31.770 --> 34:35.870
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

34:35.870 --> 34:39.650
♪I've been looking for you♪

34:39.650 --> 34:43.900
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

34:44.639 --> 34:46.139
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

34:46.139 --> 34:48.350
♪I engrave your name♪

34:52.560 --> 34:54.750
Jinzhao, why did it take so long
for you to come here?

34:55.080 --> 34:55.590
It's my fault

34:56.199 --> 34:57.040
to let you stay here

34:57.590 --> 34:58.390
for so long.

34:58.710 --> 34:59.470
How are you?

34:59.470 --> 35:00.880
They didn't give you a hard time,
did they?

35:04.200 --> 35:04.630
Guys.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.630
Eldest Brother has been waiting for you
for a long time.

35:08.280 --> 35:10.110
Don't you want to know
about your origins?

35:11.350 --> 35:12.280
Then follow me.

35:59.710 --> 36:03.390
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

36:04.740 --> 36:07.300
♪Burns what once was♪

36:08.830 --> 36:11.660
♪The name is forgotten♪

36:15.740 --> 36:19.260
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

36:20.670 --> 36:23.700
♪Only through the eyes♪

36:24.580 --> 36:27.620
♪Who can see them clearly♪

36:29.790 --> 36:35.830
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

36:37.540 --> 36:43.900
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

36:45.760 --> 36:53.250
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

36:53.800 --> 37:00.290
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

37:17.730 --> 37:21.710
♪The seemingly random paths♪

37:22.750 --> 37:25.610
♪The burning traces♪

37:26.690 --> 37:30.660
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

37:33.790 --> 37:38.090
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

37:38.720 --> 37:42.000
♪Are all carefully♪

37:42.780 --> 37:46.240
♪Arranged by me♪

37:47.710 --> 37:54.660
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

37:55.710 --> 38:02.690
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

38:03.710 --> 38:11.300
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:11.810 --> 38:18.980
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

38:19.460 --> 38:27.240
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

38:27.710 --> 38:35.260
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

38:35.650 --> 38:43.730
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

38:43.730 --> 38:51.870
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
